OL,3,GNEWSAMan with life-threatening injuries
OL,4,Aafter shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 30s is in hospital with
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after a
OL,8,Fshooting in south-east London.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police was called to
OL,11,Fthe junction of Frances Street and
OL,12,FOgilby Street in Woolwich at 20:09 BST
OL,13,Fon Thursday to reports of a shooting,
OL,14,Fwhere they found a man suffering from
OL,15,Fgunshot wounds.
OL,17,FParamedics treated a man for a head
OL,18,Finjury and took him to hospital as a
OL,19,Fpriority, the London Ambulance Service
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
